      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis thaliana&lt;/i&gt; gene &lt;i&gt;CYP707A4&lt;/i&gt; was recombinantly expressed in both insect cells using a baculovirus system |CITS:[15064374]| and yeast |CITS:[15044947]|. In both cases, the activity of the enzyme was studied using microsomal preparations. The enzyme was shown to catalyze the hydroxylation of (+)-ABA but not its enantiomer (-)-ABA |CITS:[15064374],[15044947]|.</Comment>
